    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1689bc7ab16c2eed58ea8d89",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "还有，即使来到异于学园赛场的新环境，\n强劲脚力也不见减弱，\n能立刻对应各种环境的适应能力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c26def4e4315da582633d700bd2e53101fa90c531c3f6b500c166508ca14dadb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
