      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "跑在最外圈的赛马娘跟跑在内侧的赛马娘……\n……跑过的距离并不相同吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5dcd86a93198f0e0d6598c97e6e25f3c9f20b7c04cdc0913b599bdcbe2e6555e",
