    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd6bd5ce1eee5d7b38f5b973",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "里见皇冠与特地从香港前来\n助她一臂之力的好几位赛马娘\n一起跑在她专用的训练场地上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e55e8f135356f0505ed2b6fd563ad7e914c62b1c595d3765a4d79f65560d2de5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
