      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/63/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b62c0badb9de2c01f34bd20e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……不过真亏她能准备得这么齐全啊。\n距离德比剩没几天了，明明这时期\n就连想找到并行练跑对手跟场地都不是易事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc35647527cce4cbd73e39fa0a2b082e07e8ea9a67d31a8520e42291f0f10525",
