      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "里见家将不惜一切资源协助两位，\n我们保证会提供全面性支持。\n……记得吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "483b192425339b718091b34498f073356b9a0cd0b1e9ed60ecbe5f435f84741d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
